# ============================================
# WRITE-UPS: THESIS, SLIDES, PAPERS
# --------------------------------------------
# This repository publishes the code and the experimental results. The written
# artefacts are excluded for two separate reasons.
#
# 1. Each directory below carries its OWN nested .git (they sync to Overleaf).
#    Committing them from here produces a gitlink, i.e. a submodule pointer to a
#    repository nobody else can resolve, so a fresh clone gets an empty folder.
#    Ignoring them is what keeps a clone working AND keeps the Overleaf sync
#    intact. Do not replace this with `git add` unless the nested .git is
#    removed first.
# 2. The conference papers are unpublished work under submission.
# ============================================
My_thesis_document/
My_thesis_document_SRH/
My_thesis_document_KHAS/
Thesis/
Thesis_ppt/
paper_submission_LNCS/
paper_submission_cyberMACS/

# ============================================
# PERSONAL / NOT FOR PUBLICATION
# --------------------------------------------
# Supervisor correspondence, examiner feedback, and personal defence prep.
# ============================================
Talk_with_professor.md
Joel_Mwende_Master_Thesis_Evaluation.md
DEFENCE_NOTES.md
Thesis_PPT.pptx
the-humanizer.md

